#: data/org.gnome.CharactersRb.metainfo.xml:10
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Characters is a simple utility application to find and insert unusual "
"characters.  It allows you to quickly find the character you are looking for "
"by searching for keywords."
msgstr ""
"Nokre gonger finn du rett og slett ikkje teiknet du ser etter, på "
"tastaturet. I denne appen kan du søkja etter alle moglege teikn og bruka dei "
"der du vil."

#: data/org.gnome.CharactersRb.metainfo.xml:13
msgid ""
"You can also browse characters by categories, such as Punctuation, Pictures, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Du kan òg bla gjennom alle teikna i bestemde kategoriar, som skilleteikn "
"eller bilete."

